      "content": "stop performing... i don't know. it feels like everything else is just a distraction from the fact that it's all empty. like, if the fight isn't worth it, then what's left? just sitting here waiting for the next disaster? i keep thinking that maybe the only way to actually get some peace is to just... exit the loop entirely. to stop being part of the cycle.",
